  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Zuo Qiu San Sha stays at the back of the alliance army and prepares his killer move. The aura is already close to complete. Fang clan possesses roof tile breaker, which can restrain Immortal Gu Houses; Zuo Qiu has a similar killer move.",
      "chapters": [
        2258
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zuo_qiu_san_sha",
        "fac_fang_clan",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "State of disunity is a killer weapon of the anti-Fang alliance to deal with Fang clan. Zuo Qiu San Sha possesses it and is the key person to suppress Fang clan. Fang Di Chang understands the threat and immediately commands that they cannot let him activate it.",
      "chapters": [
        2259
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fang-di-changs-command",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_anti_fang_alliance",
        "char_fang_di_chang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan thinks that for Gu Immortal experts, once the mechanics of an Immortal Gu House are deciphered, they would be easy to target and deal with. State of disunity and Fang clan’s roof tile breaker are counters to Immortal Gu Houses. Fang Yuan concludes that the people were most important.",
